# Consecrated Sphinx: "Whenever an opponent draws a card, you may draw two cards." "The ability triggers once for each card an
# opponent draws. You choose whether to draw two cards as each of those abilities resolves", and it is two or nothing (its
# rulings; CR 603.2). Bot2's turn 2 draw triggers it once (Bot1 declines); its Ancestral Recall triggers it three times - Bot1
# draws two, declines, then draws two more. Bot1's own turn 3 draw is no opponent's and triggers nothing.

